# BCG GenAI Consulting — Financial AI Chatbot Simulation

**Role:** GenAI Consultant / AI Engineer (Simulation)  
**Organization:** Boston Consulting Group (BCG) via Forage  
**Domain:** Financial Analytics, Rule-Based AI, Natural Language Querying, SEC 10-K/10-Q Report Processing  
**Tools & Tech Stack:** Python 3.x, Pandas, Rule-Based Natural Language Processing (NLP), Financial Ratio Analysis  

---

## 1. Executive Overview

During this job simulation with BCG's GenAI Consulting team, I designed and implemented a Python-powered financial AI chatbot capable of ingesting, parsing, and interpreting complex financial data from SEC filings (10-K and 10-Q reports). The chatbot applies rule-based logic and automated financial calculations to transform dense balance sheet and income statement metrics into accessible, user-friendly business insights.

---

## 2. Key Accomplishments & Deliverables

* **Financial Data Engineering:** Processed structured financial datasets from corporate 10-K/10-Q filings (Revenue, Net Income, Total Assets, Total Liabilities, Operating Cash Flow) using `pandas`.
* **Rule-Based Conversational Engine:** Developed a deterministic logic framework to process user queries, extract targeted financial metrics, and compute key performance indicators (Year-over-Year revenue growth, net profit margins, and debt-to-equity ratios).
* **Consulting & Analytical Delivery:** Structured chatbot responses to adhere to BCG's executive presentation standards, providing concise financial summaries and trend analyses alongside raw numbers.

